LoadSpriteLoopStrt: B7 CE         LDA [$CE],Y               ; Byte format: YYYYEEsy 
CODE_02A830:        C9 FF         CMP.B #$FF                ; \ Return when we encounter $FF, as it signals the end 
CODE_02A832:        F0 17         BEQ Return02A84B          ; / 
